      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Qwen 2.1 Sheet Designer Reference V1.3\n\n1. Replace Character Image; optional Reference Image 1 / 2 / 3 remain bypassed until needed. Connect each reference to the matching Designer and Sheet Encode input.\n2. Batch Out OFF (default): generate one sheet. ON: generate selected views individually through the same Output save node. Keep latent batch_size=1.\n3. Output size Auto calculates generation sizes; Manual applies width × height to the sheet (OFF) or each image (ON). Use Layout Image is a separate optional guide; it defaults OFF.\n4. Output uses Save WEBP Meta, WebP quality 70. Sheet Assemble is optional; use the separate assembly template if needed.\n\nBatch Out OFFは1枚のシート、ONは選択ビューごとの生成。同じ保存ノードを使用します。Autoは生成サイズの計算、Use Layout Imageはガイド参照の投入です。合成は任意の別テンプレートです。"
      ]
    }
